    "show_share": true,
    "description": "ELE_Net is starting an English club for AKU students to provide an opportunity to practise using English in a relaxed and friendly setting. This is part of a plan to develop a culture of using English for everyday communication and in so doing improve students' confidence and fluency when using English. Students will lead the club activities.  An ELE_Net mentor will be present in all the club meetings to guide the students. ELE_Net hopes students will be able to hold an annual show by club members. The English language Club will start soon! If you are interested in joining, sign up by emailing us at ele.net@aku.edu.",
